<view class="page"><view class="title">整理与发布</view><view class="sub">Kimi 整理后，请核对原消息再发布。</view><view class="card"><view class="label">作业日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="dateChange"><view class="badge">{{date}}</view></picker><view class="label">分配给孩子</view><checkbox-group bindchange="childChange"><label wx:for="{{children}}" wx:key="id" class="check"><checkbox value="{{item.id}}" color="#315f53"/>{{item.name}}</label></checkbox-group><textarea value="{{text}}" bindinput="textInput" maxlength="50000" placeholder="粘贴老师的消息，或上传截图 / 文件"/><button bindtap="images" disabled="{{files.length>=5}}">添加截图</button><button bindtap="files" disabled="{{files.length>=5}}">从微信会话选择 TXT / JSON 文件</button><view wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="path" class="row"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="link" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeFile">移除</text></view><view class="muted">最多 5 个文件，每个 8MB。仅支持 JPG/PNG/WEBP、UTF-8 TXT 和约定格式 JSON。消息及截图会发送给 Kimi 分析。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||!childIds.length}}">交给 Kimi 整理</button></view><view class="heading">最近导入</view><view wx:for="{{imports}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="review"><view class="row"><text>{{item.work_date}}</text><text class="badge">{{item.status==='review'?'待审核':item.status==='published'?'已发布':item.status==='failed'?'失败，可手动编辑':item.status==='running'?'分析中':'等待分析'}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.source_text || '截图消息'}}</view><view class="warning" wx:if="{{item.error}}">{{item.error}}</view><view class="link">查看与审核</view></view></view>
